# Descriptor: [B- -> D_10 l- nu, D_10 -> D0 gamma] gap mode (radiative)
# NickName: Bu_D1lnu_Dgamma_gapmodes
# Documentation: Gap mode; D_1(2420) -> D0 gamma radiative decay (not in DECAY_BELLE2.DEC).
#   BF(D_1 -> D gamma) predicted ~10% by quark model (Ref. arXiv:2605.03021).
#   Uses LLSW form factors, VSP_PWAVE for radiative sub-decay.
# Responsible: Philipp Horak
# Email: phorak@uvic.ca
# Date: 20260519

Alias D1gamma0sig D_10
Alias anti-D1gamma0sig anti-D_10
ChargeConj D1gamma0sig anti-D1gamma0sig

Decay Upsilon(4S)
1.0 B-sig B+sig  VSS;
Enddecay

Decay B-sig
0.500 D1gamma0sig  e-  anti-nu_e  PHOTOS LLSW 0.71 -1.6 -0.5 2.9;
0.500 D1gamma0sig  mu- anti-nu_mu PHOTOS LLSW 0.71 -1.6 -0.5 2.9;
Enddecay
CDecay B+sig

SetLineshapePW D1gamma0sig D*0 pi0 2
SetLineshapePW D1gamma0sig D*+ pi- 2
SetLineshapePW anti-D1gamma0sig anti-D*0 pi0 2
SetLineshapePW anti-D1gamma0sig D*- pi+ 2

Decay D1gamma0sig
1.0   D0  gamma   VSP_PWAVE;
Enddecay
CDecay anti-D1gamma0sig

End
